<p>Castillo Hotel Son Vida occupies a building with roots that reach back to a 16th-century castle, giving the property a genuine architectural history rather than a modern structure built to resemble one. The Son Vida name itself comes from Mateu Vida, a historic owner of the estate, whose family name has attached itself to this hilltop area of Palma ever since.</p>
