<p>In 1995, the hotel was bought by Germany's Schorghuber Group, and today Castillo Hotel Son Vida operates as part of Marriott's Luxury Collection, connecting a centuries-old building to a global hospitality network while retaining its own distinct architectural identity on the hill above the city.</p>
